WEBVTT

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:32.976
My mom just wanted me to have difficulty
boarding planes in the 21st century.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.018
(Laughter)

00:00:34.042 --> 00:00:36.809
She foresaw America's turn
toward nativism.

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:38.601
She was a black futurist.

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.309
(Laughter)

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:45.101
Thurston is a British name,
but we are not British.

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:48.643
Shoutout to the multigenerational,
dehumanizing economic institution

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:51.226
of American chattel slavery, though.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.684
Also, Thurston makes
for a great Starbucks name.

00:00:53.708 --> 00:00:55.434
Really expedites the process.

00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:57.333
(Laughter)

00:00:59.417 --> 00:01:02.684
My mother was a renaissance woman.